uated; after any later mutation it is stale. Submit only when you choose to finish. The trajectory permits at most 8 model calls. Action catalog: [{\"action\":\"tree\",\"description\":\"List files below one workspace-relative path.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"search\",\"description\":\"Find literal UTF-8 text below one workspace-relative path.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"query\":{\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"query\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"read\",\"description\":\"Read one complete UTF-8 workspace file.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"patch\",\"description\":\"Replace one exact string in one mutable file. The old text must occur exactly once and the expected hash must be current.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"expected_file_sha256\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"new\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"type\":\"string\"},\"old\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old\",\"new\",\"expected_file_sha256\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"replace_file\",\"description\":\"Replace one complete mutable UTF-8 file using its current file hash.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"content\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"type\":\"string\"},\"expected_file_sha256\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"cont